  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 603.02 Individual Responsibility to Supply Accurate Information. Individuals shall supply complete and truthful answers to all written and verbal questions to establish eligibility or fulfill an eligibility requirement, pursuant to RSA 167:17-b.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #5769, eff 1-3-94; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #7182, eff 12-24-99, EXPIRED: 12-24-07\n\nNew. #9063, eff 1-5-08; ss by #11042, eff 2-24-16; ss by #14380, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES 9-20-35",
